	)
	(text "ESP32-C3-WROOM-02. Straps: IO2 (LoRa NSS) + IO8 (LoRa BUSY) pulled up, IO9 = BOOT/PAIR. USB-Serial/JTAG on IO18/IO19 = flash + log."
